<%= header_section("Daily Finance Ledger Report", @report["date"]) %>
<div>
  <p>Refund fees written off: <%= @report.fetch("refund_fee_write_offs").fetch("count") %> refunds,
    <%= Money.new(@report.fetch("refund_fee_write_offs").fetch("total_cents"), "USD").format %> USD.
    These are uncollected fees, not additional cash refunds.</p>
  <p>The finance event ledger for <%= @report["date"] %> is attached as a JSON file.</p>
</div>
